{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.ChiLambdaW0SignWeighting","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ChiLambdaW0SignWeighting","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_k6_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_k6_neg","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ChiLambdaW0SignWeighting.lean#L83-L87","doc":"**Witnessed sign at `k = 6`.**  `S₆^{(w₀)} = 1/4 − 955/2 < 0`,\nmatching the empirical `c₆ ≈ −45485 < 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_k5_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_k5_neg","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ChiLambdaW0SignWeighting.lean#L77-L81","doc":"**Witnessed sign at `k = 5`.**  `S₅^{(w₀)} = 1/4 − 533/2 < 0`,\nmatching the empirical `c₅ ≈ −395.41 < 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.c6_V111","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.c6_V111","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ChiLambdaW0SignWeighting.lean#L74-L75","doc":"`c₆^{(1,1,1)} = 955/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.c6_V3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.c6_V3","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ChiLambdaW0SignWeighting.lean#L72-L73","doc":"`c₆^{(3)} = 1/4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.c5_V111","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.c5_V111","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ChiLambdaW0SignWeighting.lean#L70-L71","doc":"`c₅^{(1,1,1)} = 533/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.c5_V3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.c5_V3","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ChiLambdaW0SignWeighting.lean#L68-L69","doc":"`c₅^{(3)} = 1/4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_collapse","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_collapse","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ChiLambdaW0SignWeighting.lean#L55-L62","doc":"**Long-element weighting identity.**\nSince `χ_{(2,1)}(w₀) = 0`, the weighted sum collapses to\n`S_k^{(w₀)} = c_k^{(3)} − c_k^{(1,1,1)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ChiLambdaW0SignWeighting.lean#L50-L53","doc":"The long-element character-weighted sum at level `k`:\n`S_k^{(w₀)} = χ_{(3)}(w₀)·c₃ + χ_{(2,1)}(w₀)·c₂₁ + χ_{(1,1,1)}(w₀)·c₁₁₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chiV111_w0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chiV111_w0","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ChiLambdaW0SignWeighting.lean#L47-L48","doc":"`χ_{(1,1,1)}(w₀) = −1` (sign representation; `w₀` is odd). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chiV21_w0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chiV21_w0","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ChiLambdaW0SignWeighting.lean#L43-L45","doc":"`χ_{(2,1)}(w₀) = 0` (standard 2-d representation; trace of a\nreflection in dimension 2). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chiV3_w0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chiV3_w0","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ChiLambdaW0SignWeighting.lean#L40-L41","doc":"`χ_{(3)}(w₀) = 1` (trivial representation). ","signatureChunk":0}]}